	<object class="Event" id="{658bd3ea-470f-4fa9-b81a-bdf2c90844c3}">
		<property name="note">
			<value>One leaf of the stream's flush wooden double door swinging open, 0 -&gt; 88 deg in 0.9 s on a smoothstep (still at both ends, fastest at 0.45 s). One instance per leaf at the leaf's centre. Swing = a whole recorded swing (843829), Lead / Follow from disjoint pools, Follow 28 ms late and 2 dB down. Release = the leaf leaving its stop, once per pair (Lead only). No motor, no creak loop, nothing at rest. A pair renders about -30 LUFS (momentary max) at 3 m, 3 dB under the player's carpet steps.</value>
